# Illustration pipeline: per-run scratch. These are unanchored on purpose -
# AGENTS.md has you run the pipeline from the repo root, so verify.py's default
# --out lands at ./verify-results.csv, not under avian/scripts/. The species
# list is whatever you name it; mybirds.txt is the name AGENTS.md suggests.
# (avian/scripts/labels.txt, the bundled master list, is tracked and unaffected.)
verify-results.csv
mybirds.txt
my-species*.txt
missing-species.txt
